==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|HeartGold & SoulSilver|Sandslash|29}} from the {{TCG|HeartGold & SoulSilver}} expansion; both cards have the Fury Swipes attack.
*{{m|Fury Swipes}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Sandslash}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

